<p>SHOR HAI YEH QURAASA'N MEIN BARPA.</p>

<p>MAR GAYE HAAYE GHURBAT MEIN MOULA.</p>

<p>UTH RAHA HAIN JANAZA RAZA ASWS. KA.</p>

<p>1. YA NAHI HAI HAZEEN RONE WAALE.</p>

<p>HAAYE YASRAB MEIN HAIN RONE WAALE.</p>

<p>KISKO DE SHAAH E WAALA KA PURSA-- UTH RAHA HAIN JANAZA RAZA ASWS. KA.</p>

<p>2. GHAR KO JAANE KI PAAYI NA MOHLAT.</p>

<p>ZEHER SE MARGAYE HAAYE HAZRAT.</p>

<p>AAO SYED KO DE CHALKE KAANDHA-- UTH RAHA HAIN JANAZA RAZA ASWS. KA.</p>

<p>3. SHAAH E WAALA KI KARLU'N ZIYARAT.</p>

<p>AAQRI HAI YEH DEEDARE HUJJAT.</p>

<p>AB NAZAR AAYENGE PHIR NA MOULA-- UTH RAHA HAIN JANAZA RAZA ASWS. KA.</p>

<p>
4. MUNTAZIR HOGI BEKAS BEHEN HAAY.</p>

<p>YAAD MEIN HONGE AHLE WATAN HAAY.</p>

<p>KYA QABAR UNKO HOGI KE IS JAA-- UTH RAHA HAIN JANAZA RAZA ASWS. KA.</p>

<p>5. SHEHER KE LOG SAB RO RAHE THE.</p>

<p>TAZKIRA SHAAH KA HO RAHA THA.</p>

<p>AY RIYAAZAT QURAASA'N MEIN GHUL THA-- UTH RAHA HAIN JANAZA RAZA ASWS. KA.</p>

<p>
<center><h4>Kalaam: JANAB RIYAAZAT SAHAB.</h4></center><br />
</p>